The Volkswagen Transporter T6.1 T32 is a variant of the popular Transporter van range, distinguished by its higher Gross Vehicle Weight (GVW) of 3200kg, which allows for a greater payload capacity (around 1200-1300kg depending on specification) compared to T26, T28, and T30 models. It is typically available with the more powerful 150PS or 204PS diesel engines and can be specified across various body styles (panel van, Kombi) and trim levels (Startline, Trendline, Highline, Sportline). Its focus is on utility and carrying heavier loads.

